WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:06.760
What does SCP-066, a bundle of anomalous fleshy
string known as Eric’s Toy, want more than

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:07.800
anything else?

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:13.330
SCP Foundation researchers hoped to find out
by taking a photo of it with the Desire Camera.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:15.030
What was happening in the resulting photo?

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:19.690
“Inside the opened thoracic cavity of an
unidentified individual, with the other organs

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:20.730
removed.

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:26.240
SCP-066's "eyes" and tendrils are rearranged
to resemble a "smiley face".”

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.710
Okay, that’s horrifying.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:32.630
At least I’ll save a little money now I
don’t want to buy any lunch…

